## Ownership of ideas embodied in the code

The chromesthesia mapping (pitch → lightness, emotion-mediated warm↔cool hue,
arousal → chroma), the three Field modes, the OkLCh rendering path, and the
overall product design are original expressions protected by copyright. Access
to this repository does **not** grant a license to reimplement those expressions
in another codebase.

